```
you are ensuring that proper locking is performed when handling GEM objects. This modification helps prevent a local privileged user from exploiting the vulnerability to disclose information in the context of the kernel. By adding the explicit call to `drm_gem_object_put`, you are correctly releasing the reference to the GEM object, which helps in avoiding potential issues related to improper locking and object handling.

